{{Term/Store|Blue Sparrow|Blue Sparrows|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Blue Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Blue Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Blue Sparrow}}
Blue Sparrows are a type of [[Sparrow]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref><ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|This breed of sparrow is most often seen in the Lanayru region. They get most of their food from leaves and plants that grow near water. If it's safe enough, they can be spotted bathing in puddles or shallow rivers.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They chiefly inhabit wetlands and watersides within the [[Lanayru (Region)|Lanayru]], such as the [[Lanayru Wetlands]], the [[Zora River]], and [[Zora's Domain]].<ref name="Compendium"/> They are also found in and around the [[Great Hyrule Forest]]. Blue Sparrows feed on waterside plants and bathe in shallow [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] when safe.<ref name="Compendium"/> They can commonly be found in groups, but they will fly away if they are disturbed. When killed, Blue Sparrows drop a single [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]].

